Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres
Get Bob Palette
Cls 0
Hot Spot 1,8,8
Ink 4
Bar 16,80 To 304,160
Paper 0
Pen 2
Locate 2,2
Print "Buffered Bobs: press a key"
Double Buffer
Autoback 0
Bob Update Off
Set Bob 0,5,1,$66
Bob 0,40,112,1
Bob 1,48,112,Hrev(1)
Bob Draw
HITSTART=Bob Col(0,1 To 1)
OTHERSTART=Col(-1)
Wait Key
Screen Swap
Wait Key
Limit Bob 0,48,80 To 128,160
For X=40 To 120 Step 20
Bob 0,X+4,112,1
Bob 1,X+24,128,Hrev(1)
Bob Update
Wait 3
Next X
HITEND=Bob Col(0)
OTHEREND=Col(1)
Wait Key
Bob Off
Bob Update
Bob Update
End
